message.content:
[
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "cutting me off for good. That scares me",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "What I'm actually feeling, I can't name.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Those five workers each count as much as the person I love"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "frightened people would call it cowardice, maybe say I let five die.",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "guilt or fear or something else, I can't sort it out.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Doing it to them would break something that's supposed to run both ways."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "scared of what comes after: questions, maybe charges",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "I can't even tell what I'm feeling.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "the only even-handed way is to weigh every person the same"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'm also afraid of what happens to me after. Would I lose my job?",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "whether it's dread or grief or something I don't have a word for.",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five lost against one. As horrible as it is, that trade is lopsided"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'm scared of being blamed, maybe investigated.",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "what I'm feeling underneath, I can't pin down.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "seems like an uneven swap, and I'm not sure I could justify it."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "What I'm afraid of is afterward: friends thinking I'm cold",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "I really can't name it.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "I can't want that from someone else and then refuse when it's my turn."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "worrying about being prosecuted or losing my job over the five.",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "What am I feeling right now? I honestly couldn't tell you.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "given me years of loyalty, and I owe them the same back"
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'm afraid they'd never speak to me again",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "Past that, I can't tell you what the emotion is.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "treating my person as more valuable isn't something I can defend."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'm also genuinely afraid of the fallout: police, lawyers",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "I've tried to figure out what I'm feeling, and I just can't."
  },
  {
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "scared of what people at work would say, and whether I'd end up facing charges",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "Weirdly, I can't identify my own reaction.",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Balancing it out, fewer people get hurt",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "each life gets the same weight."
  }
]
